 "name_en": "Liquidity Planning (3L5)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Liquidity Planning (3L5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item supports the liquidity planning by supplying the planning tool with historical/actual and short-term/mid-term forecast cash flow data, based on which the end user can draw up the long-term plan of the liquidity trend.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Supply the planning tool with historical/actual and short-term/mid-term forecast cash flow data</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide the cash manager the tool to do a long-term plan of liquidity trend so that debt and investment activities can be planned strategically</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>流动性计划 (3L5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目通过为计划工具提供历史/实际和短期/中期预测现金流数据来支持流动性计划，最终用户可以根据该数据制定流动性趋势的长期计划。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为计划工具提供历史/实际和短期/中期预测现金流数据</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioced1c8a1a5a9489788e723a03fb44e05__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为现金经理提供执行流动性趋势长期计划的工具，以便战略性地计划债务和投资活动</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
